    Phase 2 candidate (proposed): Act 25 codified with v3 provenance + re-enacted marker
    
    Proposed corrected Phase 2 candidate on current main 34c3fded9108f4874328d0d49d01d827e4cd7bda. It re-applies the
    codification of Act 25 and corrects two defects in candidate 9e75aab:
    
    1. The Act 25 provenance paragraph is no longer the byte-identical Act 24 M-024
       line. It records the v3 tally (present=10 yes=9 no=0 abstain=1), the v3 bill
       digest, the Act 16 red-team integrated as section 8, and states that the
       earlier Act 24 record is superseded, not validated.
    2. The heading uses the form Act 25 section 2.2.1 names: '(re-enacted ...)'.
       Six detection sites in five scripts are widened to '\((re-)?enacted ' so the
       office remains operative (boot-smoke observed '[ 10 -eq 11 ]' with the
       statutory heading and no widening; b45e5ac).
    
    This is a proposed candidate from c1a00002, not the Clerk's act and not a
    section 4 pre-landing verification. An office other than sponsor and Clerk must
    verify this exact commit+tree before any fast-forward.

